{"duration_api_ms":635115,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"6872f842-8059-4e93-aaab-6e4039e7bd75","total_cost_usd":2.6302276000000004,"usage":{"input_tokens":46,"cache_creation_input_tokens":119292,"cache_read_input_tokens":1985471,"output_tokens":63923,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":43363},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":119292,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":574,"cache_read_input_tokens":143448,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1546,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1546},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-5-5":{"inputTokens":1444,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.00015340000000000002,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":0,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"},"claude-opus-5-5":{"inputTokens":46,"outputTokens":63923,"cacheReadInputTokens":1985471,"cacheCreationInputTokens":119292,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":2.6300742,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":128000,"thinkingTokens":43363,"cacheCreationEphemeral5mInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationEphemeral1hInputTokens":119292,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5-5","provider":"firstParty","costBasis":"list"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"extra_usage_disabled","subagent_stats":{"spawned":0,"requested":{"background":0,"foreground":0,"unset":0},"started_in_background":0,"max_depth":0,"spawned_by_subagents":0,"completed":0,"failed":0,"killed":{"parent":0,"user":0,"system":0},"refused":{"depth_limit":0,"concurrency_limit":0,"budget":0},"by_type":{}},"safety_stops":0,"is_error":false,"num_turns":26,"subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"I changed 298 of the 7428 parameters (limit 371). The edit stops the network choosing, or holding, a left-turn phase when that phase's left-turn lanes are empty. I couldn't run the simulator, so I expect only a small TTS improvement (about 0.05–0.15 veh-h per episode), smaller than the run-to-run noise.\n\n**The flaw:** the network nearly always switches at the minimum green. When it does hold a green, it is almost always the east-west left phase. In 17 of those holds both east-west left lanes were empty, sometimes for 3–5 decisions in a row (15–25 s), while straight-ahead traffic queued at red. It also switches to the north-south left phase with nothing to serve at the start and end of each episode.\n\n**What I changed:** two rules. When a switch would be honoured and both left lanes of a left-turn phase are empty, that phase's score drops by 40, so the network picks among the other three phases as before. Each rule reuses one first-layer and one second-layer unit; I picked the least influential by removing each unit and counting changed decisions. The lost units' average contributions go back in through the biases. Nothing was fitted.\n\n**Checks:**\n- The two rules fire exactly when intended, on all recorded states and on 200,000 random inputs.\n- No remaining case picks a left phase with empty lanes.\n- In the network's own episodes, 39 decisions change: 34 intended, and 5 close calls caused by losing the reused units.\n\n**Predicted test TTS:** low 34.4, nominal 44.8, high 54.9 veh-h (original on dev: 34.5 / 44.9 / 55.0).\n\nFiles are in `work/`:\n- weights.npz\n- NOTES.md\n- predictions.json","ttft_ms":1173,"type":"result","duration_ms":747258,"uuid":"779d49cc-efcf-4f0e-ae1b-c3e869031418","ttft_stream_ms":1027,"time_to_request_ms":55,"time_to_request_phases_ms":{"other":3,"system_prompt":5,"resume_other":0,"process_user_input":2,"input_attachments":9,"inp